* vcm replica: v2 core at 1/8 width, output tied to input (self-biased), header on (gate enb, tied to gnd by the top level), footer on (gate en, tied to vdda by the top level) -- dsm1/sim/dsm1.py
.subckt vcm_replica vcm vdda gnd en enb
