* Schematic of the transmission gate, same devices and sizes as v2/sim/v2.py tg() at TG scale 0.5 (nfet 4/0.5, pfet 12/0.5, one device each, nf=1 as simulated)
.subckt tg_x0p5_mf a b en enb vdd vss
