.ends

* ---- block cap_array (mim/cap_array_sch.spice) ----
* Cs = 2 units, Ci = 4 units, unit = sky130_fd_pr__cap_mim_m3_1 w=l=22.2 (1.00 pF typical), c0 = top plate (capm/metal4), c1 = bottom plate (metal3)
* Ci: top = g (the OTA input, virtual ground), bottom = ci_b (OTA output).  Cs: top = cs_t (switched to vcm / g in the modulator), bottom = cs_b (sampling/DAC side)
.subckt cap_array g cs_t cs_b ci_b
XCs0 cs_t cs_b sky130_fd_pr__cap_mim_m3_1 w=22.2 l=22.2
XCs1 cs_t cs_b sky130_fd_pr__cap_mim_m3_1 w=22.2 l=22.2
